Current marking workflow:

-> ExamPaper:
        - marking is delegated to the configured Tutor, then the AssistantLecturer
        - questions are split at the boundary closest to half the available marks; ties favor the AssistantLecturer

-> Tutor, AssistantLecturer and Lecturer:
        - Tutor and AssistantLecturer enter subtotals and can raise escalation flags
        - Lecturer regrades papers with pending escalation flags

