-- Strategy, Memento and Facade changes --------------------

-> Strategy moved from AbstractExamPaper to ExamStatisticsOriginator:
    - average and top marks need every paper, so a single paper cannot calculate them
    - ExamStatisticsOriginator is the strategy's context: calculate(papers) runs calculateStat(papers, this)
    - each strategy walks the papers with the Iterator and stores its result on the originator (setAverageMark / setMaxMark)
    - removed #strategy and calculateStats() from AbstractExamPaper

-> ExamStatisticsOriginator and StatisticsMemento:
    - passRate replaced with maxMark to match the UML
    - added setStrategy(), calculate(), and getters/setters for averageMark and maxMark

-> ExamMarkingFacade:
    - owns the ExamPaperCreator, the ExamPaperCollection, the marker chain (Tutor -> AssistantLecturer -> Lecturer), the originator and the caretaker
    - takes simple inputs and returns simple results: createExamPaper() returns the paper's index
    - added addQuestion() (papers need questions before they can be marked) and undoStatistics() (restores the last snapshot)
    - removed assignPaper(): captureMarks() assigns the marker chain itself

-> AbstractExamPaper:
    - implements getBonusMarks() and getExtraTime() so decorators can wrap it (ExamComponent changed to the decorator interface)
    - added the observers vector and implemented attach/detach/notify (they were declared but missing)
    - added getYear()
